<BaseLayout title="Contact | Bhagyashri Patil">
<header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Contact / Let's talk</span><h1>Good products start with <span class="accent">good conversations.</span></h1><p>Whether you're building a product, designing a solution, or exploring where AI can genuinely help, I'd enjoy connecting.</p></header>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Opportunities</span><div><h2>Boston area &amp; remote.</h2><p>I'm focusing my search on product management and solutions engineering opportunities, including roles that connect cloud architecture, enterprise systems, data products, and applied AI.</p><div class="cards contacts"><a class="card contact-card" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bhagyashripatil/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="eyebrow">Connect</span><h3>LinkedIn ↗</h3><p>Professional conversations, collaborations, and opportunities.</p></a><a class="card contact-card" href="https://github.com/patilbp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="eyebrow">Explore</span><h3>GitHub ↗</h3><p>Code, technical exploration, and selected repositories.</p></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-row"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Keep exploring</span><div><h2>See how I approach the work.</h2><p>Learn about my experience and the project case studies that are being developed.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/experience/">Experience →</a><a class="button secondary" href="/projects/">Projects →</a></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.accent{color:#4667d4}.contacts{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.contact-card{display:block;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}.contact-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 16px 35px #263a6612}@media(max-width:700px){.contacts{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.contact-card{transition:none}}</style>
